{"id": "v8-multi-025-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-025", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "变化较小时，这种近似很有用。变化较大时，我们必须使用原来的方程，不能沿用同一条规则。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}, "output": {"translation": "This approximation is useful when the change is small. When the change is large, we must use the original equation and cannot follow the same rule."}, "review": {"status": "approved", "reviewer": "Codex (user-authorized AI acceptance)", "method": "Codex individually read all80 teacher paragraph labels; condition and glossary repairs documented against immutable source; no release use", "at": "2026-09-30T20:47:49.786767+00:00", "content_hash": "adc88ea9aa296195aff551edef44d7eaae0b865be91f8ba379aa0f54d62a6191"}, "label_metadata": {"provider": "DeepInfra", "requested_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "response_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "at": "2026-09-30T20:42:27.890514+00:00", "parameters": {"temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 256, "response_format": "json_object", "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}, "input_hash": "3b6247897d42bc9a72b983edf6eee1975faa0bb9752d13c3e036a79a25b71451", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 222, "total_tokens": 256, "completion_tokens": 34, "estimated_cost": 2.728e-05, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}}
{"id": "v8-multi-026-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-026", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "样品在干燥前后都称过重量。最终质量较低说明有物质损失，但不能据此确定损失的是哪种物质。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}, "output": {"translation": "The sample was weighed before and after drying. The lower final mass indicates a loss of material, but it cannot determine which specific substance was lost."}, "review": {"status": "approved", "reviewer": "Codex (user-authorized AI acceptance)", "method": "Codex individually read all80 teacher paragraph labels; condition and glossary repairs documented against immutable source; no release use", "at": "2026-09-30T20:47:49.786767+00:00", "content_hash": "e85affd0c1a7f66b04a373d05f3fca88d4194f1c0dccc79aec191a8f1534fe9d"}, "label_metadata": {"provider": "DeepInfra", "requested_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "response_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "at": "2026-09-30T20:42:28.868944+00:00", "parameters": {"temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 256, "response_format": "json_object", "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}, "input_hash": "35ff7e515b62e6c91c8ae62ff3f5057d45bcfced4cc45fb48578792de5d4afce", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 221, "total_tokens": 255, "completion_tokens": 34, "estimated_cost": 2.7199999999999997e-05, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}}
{"id": "v8-multi-027-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-027", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "调查记录受访者是否选择了两个选项中的某一个。它不记录受访者对所选选项的偏好有多强。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}, "output": {"translation": "The survey records whether the respondent selected one of the two options. It does not record how strong the respondent's preference for the selected option is."}, "review": {"status": "approved", "reviewer": "Codex (user-authorized AI acceptance)", "method": "Codex individually read all80 teacher paragraph labels; condition and glossary repairs documented against immutable source; no release use", "at": "2026-09-30T20:47:49.786767+00:00", "content_hash": "f1759454910cf8723e8d8f36d420ff0e1ee9596ac13d2669bf182c6c99314241"}, "label_metadata": {"provider": "DeepInfra", "requested_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "response_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "at": "2026-09-30T20:42:29.662497+00:00", "parameters": {"temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 256, "response_format": "json_object", "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}, "input_hash": "ae3b22fe458383f7f6828a505b200f12fdd89a1926e746d614218b796363267c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 219, "total_tokens": 253, "completion_tokens": 34, "estimated_cost": 2.704e-05, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}}
{"id": "v8-multi-025-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-025", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The approximation is useful when the changes are small. For larger changes, we must use the original equation rather than extending the same rule.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}, "output": {"translation": "当变化较小时，这种近似是很有用的。对于较大的变化，我们必须使用原始方程，而不是继续沿用相同的规则。"}, "review": {"status": "approved", "reviewer": "Codex (user-authorized AI acceptance)", "method": "Codex individually read all80 teacher paragraph labels; condition and glossary repairs documented against immutable source; no release use", "at": "2026-09-30T20:47:49.786767+00:00", "content_hash": "105b815e7bdd0c4377e49478602086f90cf971fe0f0336c487a47467f1b0ef24"}, "label_metadata": {"provider": "DeepInfra", "requested_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "response_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "at": "2026-09-30T20:42:26.590568+00:00", "parameters": {"temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 256, "response_format": "json_object", "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}, "input_hash": "5b26c9fd723408147afe6b5bbb7722e95fcef72422a3c319c85705b054cc0c33", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 222, "total_tokens": 257, "completion_tokens": 35, "estimated_cost": 2.7559999999999997e-05, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}}
{"id": "v8-multi-026-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-026", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The sample was weighed before and after drying. A lower final mass indicates that material was lost, but it does not identify which material left.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}, "output": {"translation": "在干燥前后对样品进行了称重。较低的最终质量表明有材料损失，但无法确定是哪种材料流失了。"}, "review": {"status": "approved", "reviewer": "Codex (user-authorized AI acceptance)", "method": "Codex individually read all80 teacher paragraph labels; condition and glossary repairs documented against immutable source; no release use", "at": "2026-09-30T20:47:49.786767+00:00", "content_hash": "d16b7dd7c21f274673bcfba43448ec8fe9bac40dc0dcfaadf48abb54291d4406"}, "label_metadata": {"provider": "DeepInfra", "requested_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "response_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "at": "2026-09-30T20:42:28.229055+00:00", "parameters": {"temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 256, "response_format": "json_object", "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}, "input_hash": "c37d71d504cdf06083b24f9f65ad525e87f431e1118ca7d30694191236a1d797", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 223, "total_tokens": 255, "completion_tokens": 32, "estimated_cost": 2.68e-05, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}}
{"id": "v8-multi-027-zh-CN", "group_id": "v8-multi-027", "category": "academic", "input": {"text": "The survey records whether respondents chose either option. It does not record how strongly they preferred the option they selected.", "target_lang": "zh-CN", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}, "output": {"translation": "该调查记录受访者是否选择了任一选项，但不会记录他们对其所选选项的偏好程度。"}, "review": {"status": "approved", "reviewer": "Codex (user-authorized AI acceptance)", "method": "Codex individually read all80 teacher paragraph labels; condition and glossary repairs documented against immutable source; no release use", "at": "2026-09-30T20:47:49.786767+00:00", "content_hash": "03eb8810d329079e33c7183bec6430939238caa73a1905daca66b079388748f2"}, "label_metadata": {"provider": "DeepInfra", "requested_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "response_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "at": "2026-09-30T20:42:28.543297+00:00", "parameters": {"temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 256, "response_format": "json_object", "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}, "input_hash": "3732cc5ced029f5c23297d151e9397fe6f045a5e9f8b688c2ae4160d88f71f5e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "total_tokens": 244, "completion_tokens": 27, "estimated_cost": 2.492e-05, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}}
{"id": "v8-multi-001-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-001", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "我把一把备用钥匙交给管理员了。只有我们两个人都不能在你到达之前回到家时，你才去找管理员要钥匙。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}, "output": {"translation": "I gave a spare key to the administrator. You should go to the administrator for the key only if neither of us can get home before you arrive."}, "review": {"status": "approved", "reviewer": "Codex (user-authorized AI acceptance)", "method": "Codex individually read all80 teacher paragraph labels; condition and glossary repairs documented against immutable source; no release use", "at": "2026-09-30T20:47:49.784664+00:00", "content_hash": "a64e85d47830910e1b954f0d5534bb8943aad600f5c441d8ab7e83e17e18568c"}, "label_metadata": {"provider": "DeepInfra", "requested_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "response_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "at": "2026-09-30T20:42:03.141976+00:00", "parameters": {"temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 256, "response_format": "json_object", "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}, "input_hash": "9520c72b863fa0fa21ba0b75ab4edc45575bbe7c102f245d6ef7e344c3ce20d0", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 221, "total_tokens": 256, "completion_tokens": 35, "estimated_cost": 2.7479999999999994e-05, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}}
{"id": "v8-multi-002-en", "group_id": "v8-multi-002", "category": "daily", "input": {"text": "包裹已经由一位邻居取走了。你不必去取件点，但请把收据带回家。", "target_lang": "en", "context": "", "glossary": {}}, "source": {"name": "Original Codex-authored multi-sentence training paragraphs", "license": "Original synthetic project data", "training_allowed": true, "external_labeling_allowed": true}, "output": {"translation": "The package has been picked up by a neighbor. You don't need to go to the pickup point, but please take the receipt home."}, "review": {"status": "approved", "reviewer": "Codex (user-authorized AI acceptance)", "method": "Codex individually read all80 teacher paragraph labels; condition and glossary repairs documented against immutable source; no release use", "at": "2026-09-30T20:47:49.784664+00:00", "content_hash": "0f41d1240e1017e651dedf5bc9e5e224be67d17da808a00f2f6172778a097352"}, "label_metadata": {"provider": "DeepInfra", "requested_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "response_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-32B", "at": "2026-09-30T20:42:03.125030+00:00", "parameters": {"temperature": 0, "max_tokens": 256, "response_format": "json_object", "chat_template_kwargs": {"enable_thinking": false}}, "input_hash": "96a14480f3726eb4dd1ad9ced03e80ff6984a29a9f50093ab5ad5477a0d83297", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 218, "total_tokens": 251, "completion_tokens": 33, "estimated_cost": 2.668e-05, "prompt_tokens_details": null}}}
